# This git repository's root is the home directory. Only the actual
# project should ever be tracked here — everything else at this level
# (dotfiles, credentials, personal documents, unrelated projects, caches)
# is incidental and must never be staged, committed, or swept into a
# build/deploy archive by tools that walk the git working tree.
#
# Default-deny: ignore everything at this level, then explicitly
# re-allow only the real project directory.
#
# road-analysis-api was reorganized into road-risk-analysis/api (2026-10-14),
# then split into top-level modules (2026-10-20): backend/ infra/ docs/ tools/
# are tracked here. road-risk-analysis/{web,mobile,ai} are deliberately left
# ignored: each has its own independent .git repo and must never be swept
# into this (home-directory-rooted) repo as a nested/embedded one; data/ and
# logs/ are local only. Finer rules: road-risk-analysis/.gitignore.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/road-risk-analysis/
/road-risk-analysis/*
!/road-risk-analysis/backend/
!/road-risk-analysis/infra/
!/road-risk-analysis/docs/
!/road-risk-analysis/tools/
!/road-risk-analysis/README.md
!/road-risk-analysis/.gitignore
